234
00:33:40.750 --> 00:33:42.916
Ada, welcome.

235
00:33:43.000 --> 00:33:45.083
This is now your home.

236
00:33:45.166 --> 00:33:47.250
If you had had a brother,

237
00:33:47.958 --> 00:33:51.333
